  "name": "Reproducible Open Science Workflow Evaluation",
  "description": "Materials, data and scripts supporting a comparative evaluation of an integrated GitHub-Zenodo-ORCID workflow for reproducibility, traceability and transparency in scientific research. The analysis derives twelve reproducibility requirements from the literature, maps them to GitHub, Zenodo and ORCID, and scores a conventional publication-centred workflow against the integrated workflow.",
